  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Environment Protection Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Nacional de Medio Ambiente</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT CONTEMPLATES THE EXECUTION OF AN INVESTMENT PROGRAM WITH THE OBJECTIVE OF RESTORING DETERIORATED AREAS CAUSED BY DEFORESTATION, EROSION AND THE INDISCRIMINATE USE OF AGRO-CHEMICAL PRODUCTS. THE PROJECT WILL INCLUDE SOIL CONSERVATION MEASURES IN 6 CRITICAL AREAS IN THE UPPER LEMPA WATERSHED, WORKING WITH SMALL FARMERS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
